  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "keep… from 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：keep…from 与 prevent…from 或 stop…from 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Sometimes pet dogs bark at night and this "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "keeps/prevents"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " their neighbours "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "from"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " sleeping."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Sometimes pet dogs bark at night and this "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stops"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " their neighbours "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "from"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " sleeping."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "有时宠物狗夜间吠叫，这让他们的邻居睡不好觉。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
